    "preamble": "Vinayak Mahadev Alias Madhav Gound And ... vs The State Of Maharashtra And Another on 14 August, 2025 1439.25aba (1) In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Bench At Aurangabad 907 Anticipatory Bail Application No. 1439 Of 2025 Vinayak Mahadev Alias Madhav Gound And Another Versus The State Of Maharashtra And Another ..... Mr B. N. Gadegaonkar, Advocate for Applicants Mr S. B. Narwade, App for respondents/State. .....",
    "facts": "The proceedings relate to Crime No.0419/2025. The First Information Report (\"FIR\") has been lodged on 01 July, 2025 at 05:06 hours registered by the Udgir Gramin Police Station, District Latur. The occurrence of the offence is shown on 30 June 2025. The offences alleged are under Sections 123, 274, 275, 223 and 3(5) of the Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita, 2023. There are four accused persons in the FIR, out of which accused Nos2 and 3 are the Applicants in the present Application. The informant is one Santosh Madhavrao Shinde, aged 40 years.",
